@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# Diagnostic ids
+
+BND000 check.ok
+BND101 proof.laws_import_missing
+BND102 proof.unsafe_import
+BND103 check.incomplete
+BND110 checker.error
+BND120 host.stack
+BND200 cli.usage
+BND300 build.failed
+
+Ids name stable machine classes. Human messages may improve without changing the id.
